    {
      "subId": "7416501",
      "subQuestName": "Enter the ocean current",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741650101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741650101": {
            "id": "741650101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I... I sense \"reason.\" Visitors, are you the successors to Narzissenkreuz, or are you a threat?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650102"
            ]
          },
          "741650102": {
            "id": "741650102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "You have drawn your weapons. I see your answer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650103"
            ]
          },
          "741650103": {
            "id": "741650103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Narzissenkreuz...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650104"
            ]
          },
          "741650104": {
            "id": "741650104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? This thing's Narzissenkreuz?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650105"
            ]
          },
          "741650105": {
            "id": "741650105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "If you have heard my name, then you know of my quest to save the world, and there is a chance that you can be saved.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650106"
            ]
          },
          "741650106": {
            "id": "741650106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "You draw your weapons at me only because you have been misled by untruths. But this is no time for me to waste my powers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650107"
            ]
          },
          "741650107": {
            "id": "741650107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Wonder and rejoice. When all is over, I shall explain, I shall demonstrate. But now, place the Holy Blade in my hand and flee to safety.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650108"
            ]
          },
          "741650108": {
            "id": "741650108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We're not giving you the Holy Blade.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650109"
            ]
          },
          "741650109": {
            "id": "741650109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Foolish, foolish. But I forgive you and will save you nevertheless.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650110"
            ]
          },
          "741650110": {
            "id": "741650110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I can sense that the four orthants have been reversed. But the tree of flowing is not yet complete.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650111"
            ]
          },
          "741650111": {
            "id": "741650111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "It is no longer possible to save everyone. I will extend my benevolence as far as possible, even if it makes an overdraft of my own life force.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650112"
            ]
          },
          "741650112": {
            "id": "741650112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "If only five in ten can be saved, I will strive to save six in ten.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650113"
            ]
          },
          "741650113": {
            "id": "741650113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Now, I shall come to take the Holy Blade."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7416508",
      "subQuestName": "Enter the ocean current",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7416502",
      "subQuestName": "Keep moving ahead",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741650201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741650201": {
            "id": "741650201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Impossible... I had already reached the stage of \"no return.\" How have I fallen to this point?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650202"
            ]
          },
          "741650202": {
            "id": "741650202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "And I have lost all control of the Primordial Sea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650203"
            ]
          },
          "741650203": {
            "id": "741650203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Why, why has this happened? Why, why did you do this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650204"
            ]
          },
          "741650204": {
            "id": "741650204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "The new world cannot be born. All will die in a shell, a husk of a dream!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650205"
            ]
          },
          "741650205": {
            "id": "741650205",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon reckons you're the one who should try waking up from your dream.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650206"
            ]
          },
          "741650206": {
            "id": "741650206",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The end of the world is the kind of thing that everyone should work together to stop.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650207"
            ]
          },
          "741650207": {
            "id": "741650207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I see. The Holy Blade is not on my side. With each swing, it cuts through the universal will that surrounds me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650208"
            ]
          },
          "741650208": {
            "id": "741650208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Until, at last, my weak, ordinary self has returned to its physical body.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650210",
              "741650216"
            ]
          },
          "741650210": {
            "id": "741650210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Indeed, I can sense changes in the values originally entered into the world-formula.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650211"
            ]
          },
          "741650211": {
            "id": "741650211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Someone has seized control of the life-force, and someone has opened the beast-realm.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650212"
            ]
          },
          "741650212": {
            "id": "741650212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "And then, there is one more variable. That is you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650213"
            ]
          },
          "741650213": {
            "id": "741650213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "The person fated to see the all-consuming whale put to flight. The one who shall witness all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650214"
            ]
          },
          "741650214": {
            "id": "741650214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I see, I see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650221"
            ]
          },
          "741650221": {
            "id": "741650221",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I once dreamed of becoming one just like you. But that dream is now shattered.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650222"
            ]
          },
          "741650222": {
            "id": "741650222",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "All I have done is meaningless. An empty dream.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650223"
            ]
          },
          "741650223": {
            "id": "741650223",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "No, less than a dream, even. A dream is at least harmless. But I... No, you, and they... have paid so much for all I have done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650224"
            ]
          },
          "741650224": {
            "id": "741650224",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Narzissenkreuz.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650225"
            ]
          },
          "741650225": {
            "id": "741650225",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Oh, it's you. I didn't see you there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650226"
            ]
          },
          "741650226": {
            "id": "741650226",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Do you know who I actually am?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650227"
            ]
          },
          "741650227": {
            "id": "741650227",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Names are just labels. But yes, I am most familiar with the two colors that mix in your soul.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650228"
            ]
          },
          "741650228": {
            "id": "741650228",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Director Lyris does not know what has happened. She just holds onto Mary-Ann, who herself still clings to life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650229"
            ]
          },
          "741650229": {
            "id": "741650229",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "She cannot understand such a complex present and future, and hopes just to retain the past. And so, she does the only thing she can.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650230"
            ]
          },
          "741650230": {
            "id": "741650230",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "My name is Ann.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650231"
            ]
          },
          "741650231": {
            "id": "741650231",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "In that case, hello, Ann.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650232"
            ]
          },
          "741650232": {
            "id": "741650232",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "I am willing to forgive you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650233"
            ]
          },
          "741650233": {
            "id": "741650233",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "What an odd thing to say. From the very start, my plans have had lofty and sacred aims. Selfishness has never come into it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650234"
            ]
          },
          "741650234": {
            "id": "741650234",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "None may judge or criticize me, nor do I need forgiveness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650235"
            ]
          },
          "741650235": {
            "id": "741650235",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Your aims may have been lofty, but your insanity has harmed many.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650236"
            ]
          },
          "741650236": {
            "id": "741650236",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "You did not even enter the formula correctly... and what's wrong with being forgiven for a mistake?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650237"
            ]
          },
          "741650237": {
            "id": "741650237",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "...You are right. I apologize.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650238"
            ]
          },
          "741650238": {
            "id": "741650238",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "So please, Narzissenkreuz, come back with us. There are other people you need to see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650239"
            ]
          },
          "741650239": {
            "id": "741650239",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This guy seems to have become much more cooperative. But a request like that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650240"
            ]
          },
          "741650240": {
            "id": "741650240",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650241"
            ]
          },
          "741650241": {
            "id": "741650241",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Doesn't this sorta thing usually require some inner struggle and hours of persuasion?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650242"
            ]
          },
          "741650242": {
            "id": "741650242",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "As I have said before, I do not feel that I have done anything wrong. My mission has failed, but the world has been saved nonetheless.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650243"
            ]
          },
          "741650243": {
            "id": "741650243",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Let others mock and curse me. I am empty within now. Only one desire remains.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650244"
            ]
          },
          "741650244": {
            "id": "741650244",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What is it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650245"
            ]
          },
          "741650245": {
            "id": "741650245",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I, too, wish to return to the very beginning — to the time before the Narzissenkreuz heroes set off on their journey.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650246"
            ]
          },
          "741650246": {
            "id": "741650246",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "But that's impossible. We are not masters of our own fate. I no longer even have the power to determine my own dreams.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650247"
            ]
          },
          "741650247": {
            "id": "741650247",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "#Well, Knight {NICKNAME}, when you're ready, we'll proceed to reseal the primordial waters, and then we'll leave this place."
          },
          "741650216": {
            "id": "741650216",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I should have sensed the changes in the values originally entered into the world-formula. A \"variable\" has descended upon this world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650217"
            ]
          },
          "741650217": {
            "id": "741650217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Not everything from outside the universe can be called a \"presence\" or \"variable.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650218"
            ]
          },
          "741650218": {
            "id": "741650218",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "But it seems I overlooked one nonetheless. You.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650219"
            ]
          },
          "741650219": {
            "id": "741650219",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "The witness of all, the recorder of all, the designer of all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650220"
            ]
          },
          "741650220": {
            "id": "741650220",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Only one who is worth a world can bear that title."
          }
        }
      }
    },
