    },
    {
      "subId": "7416503",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741650301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741650301": {
            "id": "741650301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Impossible... I had already reached the stage of \"no return.\" How have I fallen to this point?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650302"
            ]
          },
          "741650302": {
            "id": "741650302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "And I have lost all control of the Primordial Sea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650303"
            ]
          },
          "741650303": {
            "id": "741650303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Why, why has this happened? Why, why did you do this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650304"
            ]
          },
          "741650304": {
            "id": "741650304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "The new world cannot be born. All will die in a shell, a husk of a dream!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650305"
            ]
          },
          "741650305": {
            "id": "741650305",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon reckons you're the one who should try waking up from your dream.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650306"
            ]
          },
          "741650306": {
            "id": "741650306",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The end of the world is the kind of thing that everyone should work together to stop.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650307"
            ]
          },
          "741650307": {
            "id": "741650307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I see. The Holy Blade is not on my side. With each swing, it cuts through the universal will that surrounds me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650308"
            ]
          },
          "741650308": {
            "id": "741650308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Until, at last, my weak, ordinary self has returned to its physical body.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650309"
            ]
          },
          "741650309": {
            "id": "741650309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The Primordial Sea won't overflow its banks so soon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650310"
            ]
          },
          "741650310": {
            "id": "741650310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Indeed, I can sense changes in the values originally entered into the world-formula.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650311"
            ]
          },
          "741650311": {
            "id": "741650311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Someone has seized control of the life-force, and someone has opened the beast-realm.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650312"
            ]
          },
          "741650312": {
            "id": "741650312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "And then, there is one more variable. That is you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650313"
            ]
          },
          "741650313": {
            "id": "741650313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "The person fated to see the all-consuming whale put to flight. The one who shall witness all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650314"
            ]
          },
          "741650314": {
            "id": "741650314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I see, I see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650315"
            ]
          },
          "741650315": {
            "id": "741650315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I once dreamed of becoming one just like you. But that dream is now shattered.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650316"
            ]
          },
          "741650316": {
            "id": "741650316",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "All I have done is meaningless. An empty dream.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650317"
            ]
          },
          "741650317": {
            "id": "741650317",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "No, less than a dream, even. A dream is at least harmless. But I... No, you, and they... have paid so much for all I have done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650318"
            ]
          },
          "741650318": {
            "id": "741650318",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Narzissenkreuz.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650319"
            ]
          },
          "741650319": {
            "id": "741650319",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Oh, it's you. I didn't see you there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650320"
            ]
          },
          "741650320": {
            "id": "741650320",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Do you know who I actually am?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650321"
            ]
          },
          "741650321": {
            "id": "741650321",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Names are just labels. But yes, I am most familiar with the two colors that mix in your soul.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650322"
            ]
          },
          "741650322": {
            "id": "741650322",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Director Lyris does not know what has happened. She just holds onto Mary-Ann, who herself still clings to life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650323"
            ]
          },
          "741650323": {
            "id": "741650323",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "She cannot understand such a complex present and future, and hopes just to retain the past. And so, she does the only thing she can.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650324"
            ]
          },
          "741650324": {
            "id": "741650324",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "My name is Ann.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650325"
            ]
          },
          "741650325": {
            "id": "741650325",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "In that case, hello, Ann.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650326"
            ]
          },
          "741650326": {
            "id": "741650326",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "I am willing to forgive you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650327"
            ]
          },
          "741650327": {
            "id": "741650327",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "What an odd thing to say. From the very start, my plans have had lofty and sacred aims. Selfishness has never come into it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650328"
            ]
          },
          "741650328": {
            "id": "741650328",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "None may judge or criticize me, nor do I need forgiveness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650329"
            ]
          },
          "741650329": {
            "id": "741650329",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "Your aims may have been lofty, but your insanity has harmed many.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650330"
            ]
          },
          "741650330": {
            "id": "741650330",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "You did not even enter the formula correctly... and what's wrong with being forgiven for a mistake?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650331"
            ]
          },
          "741650331": {
            "id": "741650331",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "...You are right. I apologize.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650332"
            ]
          },
          "741650332": {
            "id": "741650332",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "So please, Narzissenkreuz, come back with us. There are other people you need to see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650333"
            ]
          },
          "741650333": {
            "id": "741650333",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This guy seems to have become much more cooperative. But a request like that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650334"
            ]
          },
          "741650334": {
            "id": "741650334",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650335"
            ]
          },
          "741650335": {
            "id": "741650335",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Doesn't this sorta thing usually require some inner struggle and hours of persuasion?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650336"
            ]
          },
          "741650336": {
            "id": "741650336",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "As I have said before, I do not feel that I have done anything wrong. My mission has failed, but the world is still fated to be saved.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650337"
            ]
          },
          "741650337": {
            "id": "741650337",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "Let others mock and curse me. I am empty within now. Only one desire remains.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650338"
            ]
          },
          "741650338": {
            "id": "741650338",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What is it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650339"
            ]
          },
          "741650339": {
            "id": "741650339",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "I, too, wish to return to the very beginning — to the time before the Narzissenkreuz heroes set off on their journey.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650340"
            ]
          },
          "741650340": {
            "id": "741650340",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Narzissenkreuz",
            "text": "But that's impossible. We are not masters of our own fate. I no longer even have the power to determine my own dreams.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741650341"
            ]
          },
          "741650341": {
            "id": "741650341",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Ann",
            "text": "#Well, Knight {NICKNAME}, when you're ready, we'll proceed to reseal the primordial waters, and then we'll leave this place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7416599",
